flowchart TD
    A[Execution Evidence] --> B[Repeated Pattern]

    B --> C{"Instruction problem?"}

    C -->|No| D[Route to Other Artifact]
    C -->|Yes| E[Classify Problem]

    E --> F[Missing]
    E --> G[Ambiguous]
    E --> H[Conflicting]
    E --> I[Stale]
    E --> J[Overly Specific]

    F --> K[Candidate Change]
    G --> K
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K

    K --> L[Evidence Package]
    L --> M[Impact Analysis]
    M --> N[Owner Review]

    N --> O{Decision}

    O -->|Reject| P[Decision Record]
    O -->|Revise| K
    O -->|Approve| Q[New Version]

    Q --> R[Validation]

    R --> S{Valid?}

    S -->|No| T[Rollback / Revise]
    S -->|Yes| U[Activate]

    U --> V[Future Runs]
    V --> A
